# An external tap does not remove storage counters; the land later spends the retained counter (CR 122.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Hollow Trees
Black Lotus
Icy Manipulator
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Hollow Trees.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hollow Trees.Counters.Storage = 1
